  "prefLabel": "Pol 101.41 Termination",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pol 101.41 \"Termination\" means ceasing employment as a police or corrections officer, through either resignation, as defined in Pol 101.39, or discharge, as defined in Pol 101.17.\n\nSource. #8925, eff 7-1-07 (from Pol 101.39)",
